# Build-context hygiene for src-app/cloud-sim/worker.Dockerfile (the only Dockerfile in-tree).
# The worker image compiles from source inside its builder stage, so none of these are needed in
# the build context — excluding them shrinks a ~10GB context to the source tree and keeps the
# build hermetic (no host build artifacts leak in).
**/target
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
*.log
.lifecycle
# Runtime/generated data + local caches (never inputs to the image build).
cytoanalyst-data
**/.cloud-sim.env
**/.floci-sim.env
**/.kube-config
**/.floci-kube-config
